Terminals unused in grammar

   FOR
   INPUT
   COMMA


Grammar

    0 $accept: program $end

    1 program: /* empty */
    2        | program statement

    3 statement: INT IDENTIFIER ASSIGN expression SEMICOLON
    4          | FLOAT IDENTIFIER ASSIGN expression SEMICOLON
    5          | BOOL IDENTIFIER ASSIGN expression SEMICOLON
    6          | CHAR IDENTIFIER ASSIGN expression SEMICOLON
    7          | STRING IDENTIFIER ASSIGN expression SEMICOLON
    8          | PRINT LPAREN expression RPAREN SEMICOLON
    9          | IDENTIFIER ASSIGN expression SEMICOLON
   10          | IF LPAREN expression RPAREN block
   11          | IF LPAREN expression RPAREN block ELSE block
   12          | DO block WHILE LPAREN expression RPAREN SEMICOLON
   13          | error SEMICOLON

   14 block: LBRACE block_statement RBRACE

   15 block_statement: /* empty */
   16                | block_statement statement

   17 expression: INT_LITERAL
   18           | FLOAT_LITERAL
   19           | IDENTIFIER
   20           | expression PLUS expression
   21           | expression MINUS expression
   22           | expression DIVIDE expression
   23           | expression MULTIPLY expression
   24           | expression MODULO expression
   25           | expression EQ expression
   26           | expression NE expression
   27           | expression LT expression
   28           | expression GT expression
   29           | expression LE expression
   30           | expression GE expression
   31           | expression AND expression
   32           | expression OR expression
   33           | NOT expression
   34           | TRUE
   35           | FALSE
   36           | LPAREN expression RPAREN
   37           | STRING_LITERAL


